# This repo carries only the generator + its (secret-free) template.
# Real deployment config (parameters.txt) and everything the generator
# produces (per-VM docker-compose.yml, VM disk/storage directories) are
# runtime state, not source -- ignore everything by default and allow-list
# the files that actually belong in git.
*

!.gitignore
!README.md
!script
!mac_usb_mapping.sh
!parameters.txt.example
!install.sh
!cleanup.sh
!bridge/
!bridge/*
